SUMMARY:2026 Bachata Sensual Festival Houston - 10% Discount
DESCRIPTION:Use promo code GOLD to save 10% on your pass!\nJoin us to celebrate 5 years of the Bachata Sensual Festival Houston featuring the very own bachata sensual creators Korke & Judith.\n\n\nJoin us during Memorial Day Weekend for the FIFTH EDITION of the Bachata Sensual Festival Houston brought to you by Bachata Sensual America. Every day you will experience top-notch workshops from the best of the best and social dancing until 7AM with some of the world’s best bachata DJs! For more information including the event schedule and details please visit www.bachatasensualamerica.com \n********************** \nWHAT TO EXPECT? \n********************** \n❤️‍🔥 3 Full Days of Dancing Until LATE NIGHT \n❤️‍🔥 The Best Bachata Sensual Instructors Line-up EVER seen in Texas \n❤️‍🔥 The Best Bachata Sensual DJs Line-up EVER seen in Texas \n❤️‍🔥 Stunning performances EVERY night \n❤️‍🔥 World Class MCs and Entertainment \n❤️‍🔥 LIVE Concert by Surprise Artist \n❤️‍🔥 Pool Parties \n❤️‍🔥 Intensive Training Programs \n********************** \nPASSES 🎫 \n********************** \n⚠️ Passes on sale 🎟 \nhttps://BSFH2026.eventbrite.com/ \nNote: Full Passes Sales Will Be Limited to ensure the highest quality of instruction. Last Day for Any Pass Transfers is MAY 1\, 2026 (Subject to Transfer Fee). NO REFUNDS ALLOWED. \n********************** \nWHEN & WHERE \n********************** \n📅 Dates: May 21-25\, 2026 \n📍 Where: Sheraton Houston Brookhollow\, 3000 N Loop W\, Houston\, TX\, 77092 \n********************** \nFEATURED ARTISTS* \n********************** \n🇪🇸 🇪🇸 Korke & Judith (Spain) – Creators of Bachata Sensual \n🇪🇸 🇪🇸 Pablo & Raquel (Spain) – Bachata World Champions \n🇪🇸 🇪🇸 Alonso & Noelia (Spain) \n🇪🇸 🇪🇸 Dario & Sara (Spain) \n🇪🇸 Gloria Ramos (Spain) \n🇩🇴 🇩🇴 Carlos & Susan (Dominican Republic) \nBachata Sensual 🇺🇸 Ambassadors \n********************** \nFEATURED DJs \n********************** \nBachata Room \n🎧 🇸🇪 DJ Khalid – Sweden \n🎧 🇪🇸 DJ Tony – Spain \n🎧 🇺🇸 DJ Emerzive – Houston \n🎧 🇺🇦 DJ Valeria – Ukraine \n🎧 🇺🇸 DJ Damian – Houston \n🎧 🇺🇸 DJ Encanto – Bay Area \n🎧 🇺🇸 DJ Timothy – Detroit \n🎧 🇺🇸 DJ Irakli – Austin \n🎧 🇺🇸 DJ Greedless – Houston \n🎧 🇺🇸 DJ Jose – Dallas \nZouk Room / Salsa Room \n********************** \nFEATURED CONCERT \n********************** \n🎶Surprise Artist \n********************** \n🏨 Hotel Rooms \n********************** \nBook Your Room Now! Special Rate available for the event! \nLink -> https://www.bachatasensualamerica.com/bsfhhotel \n********************** \n📆 SCHEDULE \n********************** \nThursday May 21 \n9pm-2am – Pre-Party at The Palladium \n———————- \nFriday May 22 \n12pm-7pm – Workshops \n4pm-9pm – Pool Party \n10pm-7am – Social Dancing & Showcase (2 Rooms – Bachata\, Salsa / Zouk) \n———————- \nSaturday May 23 \n12pm-7pm – Workshops \n4pm-9pm – Pool Party \n10pm-7am – Showcase\, Social Dancing & Concert (2 Rooms – Bachata\, Salsa / Zouk) \n———————- \nSunday\, May 25 \n12am-7pm – Workshops \n4pm-9pm – Pool Party \n11pm-7am – Social Dancing (2 Rooms – Bachata\, Salsa / Zouk) \n********************** \n*ARTIST LINE-UP SUBJECT TO CHANGE \nMore Information at https://www.bachatasensualamerica.com \nAll purchases are final. No refunds allowed. Pass Transfers Deadline May 1\, 2026. (Subject to $35 Transfer Fee/pass) \nAll tickets are subject to the rules of conduct and terms described at: https://www.bachatasensualamerica.com/codeofconduct
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/bachata-sensual-festival-houston-2026/
LOCATION:Sheraton Houston Brookhollow Hotel\, 3000 North Loop W\, Houston\, TX\, 77092\, United States
CATEGORIES:Houston
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://golatindance.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/301353_image.png
END:VEVENT
