SUMMARY:Bailar En FDR! @The Gateway Plaza at FDR Park!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable night of Latin dancing at our new location\, Gateway Plaza in FDR Park. \n**Event Details**\n– Date: May 22nd\, 2026\n– Time: 7 PM – 11 PM\n– Location: Gateway Plaza @ FDR Park \n**Schedule**\n– 7 PM: Salsa & Bachata Lesson\n– After the lesson: Dance to the beats of DJ Valentin from Dance Philly \n**Food**\nTaqueria Morales will be on-site selling delicious tacos and Mexican antojitos. Come hungry! \n**Tickets**\nGet your free tickets here:\nhttps://events.ticketleap.com/events/fairmountpark/bailar-en-fdr-salsa-class-social-dance \n**Parking & Directions**\n– Location: Gateway Plaza is at the corner of Broad and Pattison Avenue inside FDR Park.\n– By Car:\n– Enter at Broad Street & Pattison Avenue.\n– Turn right and follow signs to the parking lot.\n– Additional free parking is available along the loop road and across from the Anna C. Verna Playground (half-mile walk).\n– Public Transit:\n– Use SEPTA to the Broad Street Line’s NRG Station (last stop).\n– A 2-minute walk to the Plaza.\n– Bike:\n– The nearest Indego bike station is at Broad and Pattison. \n— **Questions?**\nContact: [programs@myphillypark.org] \n**Support Our Parks**\nJoin the Fairmount Park Conservancy’s Fair Play Campaign to help create healthy park infrastructure and expand community programs. Learn more at [fairplayphilly.org](https://fairplayphilly.org). \n**More Latin Dancing Events**\nFor more Latin dancing events\, visit: https://dancephilly.com
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/bailar-en-fdr-the-gateway-plaza-at-fdr-park/
LOCATION:Gateway Plaza at FDR Park\, Broad Street and Pattison Avenue\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 19145\, United States
CATEGORIES:Philadelphia
END:VEVENT
