SUMMARY:BGC Dance Showcase & Social
DESCRIPTION:Experience the BGC Dance Showcase & Social! Social hour\, live performances\, and social dancing—all supporting our Scholarship Fund. \nBGC Dance Showcase & Social\nJoin us for an unforgettable night of dance\, connection\, and community at the BGC Dance Showcase & Social! 💃✨ \nNow in its fourth edition\, this event brings together the energy and artistry of our BGC dance teams for their in-person season debut — plus special guest performances from some of our favorite dancers and teams across the Seattle dance community! The full performance lineup is coming soon\, and you won’t want to miss it. \nAfter the show\, stick around for a night of social dancing and refreshments as we celebrate movement\, music\, and each other. 🌟 \nAll proceeds from the night go directly to the BGC Dance Scholarship Fund\, helping make dance education accessible and empowering for all. \nCome for the performances\, stay for the community — and let’s make this a night to remember! 💖 \nSchedule for the Evening\n7:30PM – Doors Open\n7:30-8:30PM – Social Hour: Mix and mingle as you enjoy refreshments and snacks.\n8:30-9:30PM – Performances: Experience this season’s debut performances by the talented BGC dancers and more!\n9:30-11PM – Social Dancing: End the night with social dancing with our incredible DJ José Centeno on the controllers! \nTicket Options:\nShowcase-Only Ticket: Access to the social hour and performances only.\nShowcase & Social Dancing Ticket: Access to social hour\, performances\, and social dancing\nVIP: The full BGC experience — social hour\, performances\, social dancing\, and 1 reserved chair for the show included! \nImportant Ticket Info: \nAll proceeds from the event will go directly to the BGC Dance Scholarship Fund\, which helps make dance education accessible to aspiring dancers. \nThis year\, our bar will be serving non-alcoholic beverages only. \n✨ Come celebrate a night of movement\, music\, and community — get your tickets now!
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/bgc-dance-showcase-social/
LOCATION:Russian Community Center\, 704 19th Ave E\, Seattle\, WA\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golatindance.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1000043005.jpg
END:VEVENT
